# QE/EPW run artifacts (~1.4 GB: out/, save/, Wannier/EPW binaries, logs) are all
# regenerable with `nu run_pipeline.nu` -- do NOT commit them. Allowlist strategy:
# ignore everything, then re-include the authored sources + docs + scripts + the three
# small files A1 parses (epwdata.fmt = dims/H/D/Born/eps; crystal.fmt = cell volume;
# wigner.fmt = WS vectors + degeneracies). These three let the Rust readers + tests run
# without regenerating the ~1.4 GB of EPW output.
*
!.gitignore
!*.in
!*.nu
!*.md
!*.patch
!epwdata.fmt
!crystal.fmt
!wigner.fmt
!generate-k-mesh.py

# ...but not the transient QE scratch input
input_tmp.in
